# "Destroy target land" (CR 115.1, 701.8): any land, a basic one among them (unlike Wasteland), but nothing else. Bot2's Mox
# Pearl is refused as a target and its Island, the control, is destroyed; Strip Mine's own controller pays by tapping and
# sacrificing it (CR 602.2b). Taps for {C} on turn 1 first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Forest
Forest x5
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Island x5
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add)
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Island
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Strip Mine
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
